# Fixture: stretched N2 (2.2 A), CASSCF(6,6) with 2 singlet roots and the
# molecule divided into two fragments - the CASSCF variant of the local spin
# analysis (per-root printing).
! RHF def2-SVP def2-SVP/C TightSCF
%pal nprocs 2 end
%maxcore 2000
%casscf
  nel 6
  norb 6
  mult 1
  nroots 2
end
* xyz 0 1
N(1) 0 0 0
N(2) 0 0 2.2
*
